TITLE Cu K-edge EXAFS calculation

* Calculation control
CONTROL 1 1 1 1 1 1
PRINT 1 0 0 0 0 3

* Absorption edge
EDGE K
TARGET 1

* Cluster radius
RMAX 8.0

* SCF parameters
SCF 7.0

* Multiple scattering order
NLEG 4

* Temperature effects
DEBYE 300 315

* Atomic coordinates
ATOMS
  0  Cu   0.0000   0.0000   0.0000
  1  Cu   2.5560   0.0000   0.0000
  2  Cu  -2.5560   0.0000   0.0000
  3  Cu   0.0000   2.5560   0.0000
  4  Cu   0.0000  -2.5560   0.0000
  5  Cu   0.0000   0.0000   2.5560
  6  Cu   0.0000   0.0000  -2.5560
END
